# Day 3 Complete

**Love: {love}**

Today, Yume noticed whether Kazu remembered something she had actually told him.

Later, she sent him a photo for the first time.

And someone outside YumeChat noticed Kazu had been disappearing.

Maybe tomorrow will be quieter.

